{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgpKKCebuSwf9EqKXGC7x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CL3iJfit13KrZkjziX3vKC","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\007\\.collab\\tasks\\007\\attention.json","content":"{\n  \"question\": \"AC-022 要求 check-unused 对 lib 报告 0 个未使用项，且 scripts/check-fast.mjs 会无参运行 scripts/check-*.mjs，所以 check-unused 在 lib 上必须退出 0。但基准 f6f6057 上 lib/contract/validate.mjs:45 有一个未导出、全仓无引用的死函数 typeOf（T-004 遗留）。它不在 T-007 的 write_scope 内，所以按现在的范围，任务无法让 AC-022 通过。请问怎么处理？\",\n  \"options\": [\n    \"A：批准把 lib/contract/validate.mjs 加入 T-007 的 write_scope（主仓库与本工作区的 task-graph.json 都要写入），实现者只删除 typeOf 这一个函数，其余不动\",\n    \"B：不批准改 validate.mjs，改为在 check-unused 里加一份显式的豁免清单，把 lib/contract/validate.mjs 的 typeOf 登记进去（会削弱 AC-022 的「对 lib 报告 0」）\",\n    \"C：不批准，AC-022 里「对 lib 报告 0」降级为「对 lib 只报告 validate.mjs 的 typeOf」，由 T-004 的后续任务清理\"\n  ],\n  \"default\": \"A\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1314,"cache_read_input_tokens":102953,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1314},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"431fe411-7cc1-4856-b3b1-5ba30e130aba","uuid":"0293f1ca-0013-43d2-b612-0dd9252b6cb4","timestamp":"2026-11-07T21:58:05.136Z","request_id":"req_011CgpKKCQU7xrjpnYhMdPxr","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01CL3iJfit13KrZkjziX3vKC":{"file_path":"C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\007\\.collab\\tasks\\007\\attention.json","content":"{\n  \"question\": \"AC-022 要求 check-unused 对 lib 报告 0 个未使用项，且 scripts/check-fast.mjs 会无参运行 scripts/check-*.mjs，所以 check-unused 在 lib 上必须退出 0。但基准 f6f6057 上 lib/contract/validate.mjs